Name: LiveCode

Synonyms: livecode

Type: glossary

Description:
The xTalk development environment from LiveCode Ltd. that <OpenXTalk>
is based on. In 2021 LiveCode Ltd. stopped making its open-source
Community Edition, and OpenXTalk carries on from that code. OpenXTalk is
not affiliated with LiveCode Ltd.

References: OpenXTalk (glossary), xTalk (glossary)
